# Token of a logged in user (admin token for the admin requests)
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Checkout: turns the cart into an order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shippingAddress": "12 Nile St, Mansoura, Egypt" }

### My orders (?status=pending&page=1&limit=10)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One order (owner or admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel (owner or admin) - gives the stock back
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All orders (admin) (?userId=<user-uuid>&status=paid)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change the status (admin): pending -> paid -> shipped -> delivered
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "paid" }
